	(descr "JAMMA 56-position gold fingers. Pitch 3.96 mm (0.156 in). Finger 2.30 x 8.00 mm. F.Cu pads P1-P28 are the parts side. B.Cu pads S1-S28 are the solder side. Pin 7 is the key on both sides: no finger, and a 3.20 x 6.00 mm notch on Edge.Cuts. Mating edge is x=0. Board thickness 1.6 mm.")
